1,Kanuri people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanuri_people,"[14] Kanuri speak varieties of Kanuri, one of the Nilo-Saharan languages. Divisions include the Manga, Tumari, and Bilma dialects of Kanuri and the more distinct Kanembu language. [15] Inheriting the religious and cultural traditions of the Kanem-Bornu state, the Kanuri people are predominantly Sunni Muslim.","Kanuri, Tumari",Nilo-Saharan
